# Keep the build context small: only the Kotlin Toolchain bootstrap script,
# the project model and the module sources are needed to build the images.
*
!kotlin
!project.yaml
!trail
!lookout
!campground
!**/Dockerfile

# Do not ship local development data (contains configuration with secrets)
**/dev-data

# Ignore build outputs, IDE files and macOS noise inside the modules
**/build
**/.DS_Store
